            "sid": "NUM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha bukiizi obw'obulyo, nuho habege ebendera ey'orukande orwa Rubbeni omu bitabu byabo, omwebembezi w'abantu ba Rubbeni nuwe Erizura mutabani wa Sedura, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ihe rye ryona obu lyabazirwe, likahikya abantu emitwaro ena, mu kakaaga n'ebitaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarateeraga orukande enyuma ye, nubo ab'oruganda rwa Simyoni, omwebembezi w'abantu be nuwe Serumyeri mutabani wa Serisadayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ihe rye ryona obu lyabazirwe likahikya abantu emitwaro etaano, mu kenda n'ebisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurateho ab'oruganda rwa Gaadi, omwebembezi w'abantu be nuwe Eryasafu mutabani wa Lehweri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ihe rye obu lyabazirwe likahikya abaserikale emitwaro ena mu nkumi itaano rukaaga n'ataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhendo gwona ogw'omu rukande orwa Rubbeni nkooku baahandikirwe omu mahe gaabo, bakahika mitwaro ikumi n'etaano, rukumi bbina n'ataano. Abaana ba Isirairi obu baraabaga nibaimukya kugenda, abo nubo baraabaga ba kabiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
