          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ha rubaju orwa Burugaizooba, habeyoga ebendera ey'oruganda rw'Efuraimu, nkooku bategekerwe omu mahe gaabo, omwebembezi ow'abantu be, nuwe Erisama mutabani wa Amihudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ihe rye obu lyabazirwe, likahikya abaserikale emitwaro ena n'ebitaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaraateeraga orukande enyuma ye nubo ab'oruganda rwa Manaase, omwebembezi ow'abantu be nuwe Gamalyeri mutabani wa Pedazura, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ihe rye obu lyabazirwe likahikya abaserikale emitwaro esatu nkumi ibiri, n'ebibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurateho oruganda rwa Benyamiini omwebembezi w'abantu be nuwe Abidaani mutabani wa Gidyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe rye obu lyabazirwe, likahikya abaserikale emitwaro esatu nkumi itaano, ne'bbina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhendo gwona ogw'abantu ab'omu rukande orwa Efuraimu nkooku baahandiikirwe omu mahe gaabo bakahika mitwaro ikumi kanaana n'ekikumi. Abaana ba Isirairi obu baraabaga nibaimukya kugenda, abo nubo babege ba kasatu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
