        {
          "text": "Ogu nugwo omuhendo ogw'abantu ba Isirairi, nkooku baabazirwe omu bitabu ebya baisenkurubo; boona abaabazirwe omu nkande zoona nkooku bakaba bategekerwe omu mahe gaabo, bakahika emitwaro nkaaga, nkumi isatu, mu bitaano n'ataano. ",
